+
+Stream B, master context §§2,5,6,9; one writer, only the separate [test Sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13WC54eKp6kLnE05XCey38q7aZHYrnrs6bpBQP5J3QtM/edit) and bound [test Apps Script](https://script.google.com/u/0/home/projects/1ILKjMLjbVErqsUMbz0-Cx0FbifI0R0aPpt5mDlNKmG0hfDdk3F-Y5BWd/edit). Before: GGB 15 plus MAG 10 synthetic items, 56 journal events, GGB row 18 and journal row 58 empty. Test Code.gs editor copy equalled its baseline LF SHA256 `D1D4DEE32188B35807DD8B3C5A0F6DEAEE7EF14C4C8A1B14769E4844E0A090AD`. A syntax-checked temporary wrapper was appended to **test Code.gs only**, guarded by exact test Sheet ID and exact synthetic A26 title, to delay the return 20 seconds **after** a committed Add. It was saved and `/dev` reloaded; no deployment was updated.
